      hu: ["Az Ashanti aranybánya 1897 óta működik", "A bánya több mint 1500 méter mélyre nyúlik", "A világ egyik leggazdagabb aranylelőhelye", "Lakossága körülbelül 175 ezer fő", "A várost hegyes, dombos trópusi erdőség veszi körül", "A bányászat adja a város gazdaságának 80 százalékát"],
      ro: ["Mina AngloGold Ashanti operează aici din anul 1897.", "Este considerat centrul industriei aurifere din Ghana.", "Situat la aproximativ 60 de kilometri sud de orașul Kumasi.", "Populația sa depășește 175.000 de locuitori.", "Aurul extras a fost un factor critic în economia regiunii Ashanti.", "Orașul este înconjurat de dealuri și păduri tropicale dense."],
      en: ["Located in the Ashanti Region, south of the capital Kumasi.", "The Obuasi Gold Mine has been in active commercial operation since 1897.", "Recognized historically as one of the top ten largest gold mines globally.", "Operated primarily by AngloGold Ashanti, a major international corporation.", "The local topography is defined by rolling hills and dense tropical vegetation.", "Mining activities have significantly shaped the town's demographic growth."]
