    id: "taifa-cities-v2",
    type: "city",
    parent: "GH-AA",
    coords: [-0.25, 5.65],
    name: { de: "Taifa", hu: "Taifa", ro: "Taifa", en: "Taifa"},
    image: "/poi-images/taifa-cities-v2.webp",
    description: { de: "Taifa ist ein expandierendes Stadtgebiet im Ga East Municipal District.", hu: "Taifa egy terjeszkedő városi terület a Ga East önkormányzati kerületben.", ro: "Taifa este o zonă urbană în expansiune situată în districtul municipal Ga East.", en: "Taifa is an expanding urban area located in the Ga East Municipal District." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Die Stadt Taifa hat eine geschätzte Bevölkerung von über 68459.", "Es ist ein bedeutendes städtisches Zentrum in der Region GH-AA Ghanas."],
      hu: ["Taifa városának becsült lakossága több mint 68459 fő.", "Jelentős városközpont Ghána GH-AA régiójában."],
      ro: ["Orașul Taifa are o populație estimată la peste 68459.", "Este un centru urban semnificativ în regiunea GH-AA din Ghana."],
      en: ["The city of Taifa has an estimated population of over 68459.", "It is a significant urban center in the GH-AA region of Ghana."]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Taifa ist eine weitere rasant gewachsene Vorstadt im Nordwesten Accras, die durch ihre dichte Bebauung und lebendige informelle Wirtschaft charakterisiert ist. Gegründet von Ga-Migranten, zog der Ort bald Menschen aus allen Teilen Ghanas an, die im Schatten der Hauptstadt ein neues Leben suchten. Die steilen Hügel der Umgebung sorgen in der Regenzeit oft für logistische Herausforderungen, doch die enge Gemeinschaft der Bewohner prägt den städtischen Alltag. Geografie K6 — Urbanisierung.",
      hu: "Taifa egy sűrűn beépült agglomerációs központ Accra északnyugati határánál. A település az utóbbi évtizedekben drámai átalakuláson ment keresztül, faluból nyüzsgő kereskedelmi csomóponttá válva, amely összeköti a fővárost a hegyvidéki peremkerületekkel. Társadalom K7 — városi peremvidékek növekedése.",
      ro: "Taifa reprezintă una dintre enclavele comerciale și rezidențiale aglomerate din partea nordică a capitalei Accra. Oferind spații de locuit la prețuri mai accesibile în anii 1980, localitatea a înregistrat un val masiv de noi rezidenți. Pe lângă zonele rezidențiale, Taifa este faimoasă pentru numărul mare de mici afaceri rutiere și artizanale. Străzile sale înguste sunt animate de la primele ore ale dimineții, susținute de comercianți, mecanici auto și transportatori independenți. Societate K6 — economie informală.",
      en: "Taifa is a bustling residential suburb located within the Ga East Municipal District, situated on the northern outskirts of Accra. Originally a small farming community at the base of the Akwapim mountain range, it was quickly absorbed by the urban sprawl of the capital during the late 20th century. Today, Taifa is characterized by a high population density, a vibrant street economy, and its role as a key transit node connecting inner-city Accra to the northern peri-urban areas. The suburb is known for its strong community networks and localized markets, providing affordable housing for thousands of daily commuters. Geography K7 — peri-urban expansion."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Vorstadt im Nordwesten Accras", "Gegründet von Ga-Migranten", "Dichte Bebauung an steilen Hügeln", "Starke informelle Wirtschaft", "Logistische Probleme in der Regenzeit", "Enge Gemeinschaftsstruktur"],
      hu: ["Accra északnyugati elővárosa a Ga Kelet körzetben", "Lakossága meghaladja a 60 ezer főt", "Szorosan egybeolvadt a szomszédos Dome városrésszel", "Nagyrészt informális szektorban dolgozó lakosságnak ad otthont", "Fejlődését a vidékről városba áramló migráció gyorsította fel", "Kiemelkedő a helyi szintű kiskereskedelem"],
      ro: ["A crescut ca o suburbie datorită costurilor scăzute din anii 1980.", "Este faimos pentru prezența masivă a afacerilor și atelierelor mici.", "Populația este un mozaic de muncitori imigrați și familii tinere.", "Densitatea populației depășește multe alte districte ale capitalei.", "Face parte din municipalitatea Ga East.", "Comerțul stradal reprezintă baza economică pentru majoritatea locuitorilor."],
      en: ["Located in the Ga East Municipal District of the Greater Accra Region.", "Sits near the southern foothills of the Akwapim mountain range.", "Functions as a densely populated commuter suburb for central Accra.", "Evolved rapidly from a farming village into an urban center in the 1990s.", "Features a highly active informal economy and local street markets.", "Connected to the main Achimota-Ofankor highway corridor."]
    }
