    image: "/poi-images/agogo-cities-v2.webp",
    description: { de: "Agogo ist bekannt für sein presbyterianisches Krankenhaus und fruchtbare landwirtschaftliche Flächen.", hu: "Agogo presbiteriánus kórházáról és termékeny mezőgazdasági területeiről híres.", ro: "Agogo este bine-cunoscut pentru spitalul său prezbiterian și terenurile agricole fertile.", en: "Agogo is a prominent town in the Asante Akim North District, serving as a regional trade center." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Die Stadt Agogo hat eine geschätzte Bevölkerung von über 28271.", "Es ist ein bedeutendes städtisches Zentrum in der Region GH-AH Ghanas."],
      hu: ["Agogo városának becsült lakossága több mint 28271 fő.", "Jelentős városközpont Ghána GH-AH régiójában."],
      ro: ["Orașul Agogo are o populație estimată la peste 28271.", "Este un centru urban semnificativ în regiunea GH-AH din Ghana.", "en: The city of Agogo has an estimated population of over 28271.", "It is a significant urban center in the GH-AH region of Ghana."],
      en: ["Major town in the Asante Akim North District", "Estimated population is over 31,713", "Well-known for its large Presbyterian hospital", "Center for watermelon production and agriculture"]
    }, image: "/poi-images/agogo-cities-v2.webp",
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Eingebettet in ein fruchtbares Tal in der Ashanti-Region, hat sich Agogo den Ruf als Plantain-Hauptstadt Ghanas erarbeitet, da hier unglaubliche Mengen an Kochbananen angebaut werden. Die Stadt wurde in den 1930er Jahren durch das presbyterianische Krankenhaus bekannt, das noch heute zu den besten medizinischen Einrichtungen im Hinterland zählt. Durch die Ansiedlung großer Rinderherden durch Fulani-Hirten in der Region kam es jedoch in den letzten Jahren immer wieder zu Spannungen mit den lokalen Bauern. Geografie K6 — Landkonflikte.",
      hu: "Agogo egy hegyvidéki kisváros az Ashanti Régió szélén, amely hűvösebb klímájának köszönhetően az ország egyik legfontosabb zöldségtermelő vidéke. A település híres a hatalmas útifű- és paradicsomültetvényeiről, valamint a nagy presztízsű presbiteriánus kórházáról és oktatási intézményeiről. Gazdaság K7 — speciális mezőgazdaság.",
      ro: "Agogo se profilează armonios pe Platoul Kwahu, cu un climat plăcut, remarcabil de răcoros, unic în Regiunea Ashanti. Așezarea a fost favorizată istoric de misiunile religioase prezbiteriene care au construit aici instituții masive de educație și spitale de mare calibru. Agogo Hospital este și astăzi unul dintre punctele forte de cercetare medicală din provincie. Dincolo de progresul științific, relieful său cu ierburi proaspete atrage ferme extensive de vite, inițiate adesea de comunitățile fulani. Geografie K7 — impactul altitudinii.",
      en: "Agogo is a prominent town in the Ashanti Region, serving as the capital of the Asante Akim North Municipal District. The town is situated on a lush, elevated plateau, giving it a relatively cool and damp climate ideal for agriculture. Agogo is nationally famous for its commercial production of plantains, earning it the nickname as the 'plantain capital' of Ghana. In addition to its agricultural prowess, the town is a major educational and healthcare center, hosting the Agogo Presbyterian Hospital—one of the oldest and most respected medical facilities in the region—and the Agogo Presbyterian Women's College of Education. Geography K7 — specialized agricultural centers."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Ruf als Plantain-Hauptstadt", "Anbau riesiger Mengen von Kochbananen", "Presbyterianisches Krankenhaus (1930er)", "Beste medizinische Einrichtung im Hinterland", "Spannungen mit Fulani-Hirten", "Ansiedlung großer Rinderherden"],
      hu: ["Az Ashanti Régió Asante Akim North körzetének központja", "Magasabb tengerszint feletti fekvése hűvösebb mikroklímát biztosít", "Ghána legfőbb útifű- (plantain) termelő területeinek egyike", "Az Agogo Presbiteriánus Kórház 1931 óta működik", "Lakossága mintegy 35 ezer fő", "Történelmileg az Ashanti Birodalom védőbástyája volt kelet felől"],
      ro: ["Climatul său este vizibil mai răcoros datorită altitudinii superioare.", "Spitalul Prezbiterian Agogo este renumit în întreaga țară din anii 1930.", "A găzduit decenii la rând păstori transhumanți Fulani.", "Produce numeroase plante verzi și furaje destinate zootehniei.", "Zona este considerată a fi ideală pentru turism montan și ecologic.", "Are o istorie îndelungată ca important sit al misiunii prezbiteriene."],
      en: ["Capital of the Asante Akim North Municipal District in the Ashanti Region.", "Nationally renowned as a massive center for commercial plantain production.", "Located on a raised plateau, resulting in a cooler local microclimate.", "Home to the historic Agogo Presbyterian Hospital, established in 1931.", "Hosts the Agogo Presbyterian Women's College of Education.", "The surrounding landscape is dominated by dense, fertile forest reserves."]
    }
