    name: { de: "Oduponkpehe", hu: "Oduponkpehe", ro: "Oduponkpehe", en: "Oduponkpehe"},
    image: "/poi-images/oduponkpehe-cities-v2.webp",
    description: { de: "Oduponkpehe ist eine aufstrebende städtische Siedlung in der Zentralregion, Teil des weiteren Awutu Senya-Gebiets.", hu: "Oduponkpehe egy feltörekvő városi település a Középső régióban, a tágabb Awutu Senya terület része.", ro: "Oduponkpehe este o așezare urbană emergentă în Regiunea Centrală, parte a zonei mai largi Awutu Senya.", en: "Oduponkpehe is a rapidly growing residential and commercial town in the Central Region." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Die Stadt Oduponkpehe hat eine geschätzte Bevölkerung von über 42000.", "Es ist ein bedeutendes städtisches Zentrum in der Region GH-CP Ghanas."],
      hu: ["Oduponkpehe városának becsült lakossága több mint 42000 fő.", "Jelentős városközpont Ghána GH-CP régiójában."],
      ro: ["Orașul Oduponkpehe are o populație estimată la peste 42000.", "Este un centru urban semnificativ în regiunea GH-CP din Ghana.", "en: The city of Oduponkpehe has an estimated population of over 42000.", "It is a significant urban center in the GH-CP region of Ghana."],
      en: ["Rapidly growing town in the Central Region", "Estimated population exceeds 26,110", "Serves as a major residential area for workers in Accra", "Known for its vibrant local markets and transport links"]
    }, image: "/poi-images/oduponkpehe-cities-v2.webp",
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Ursprünglich unter dem Namen Kasoa Zongo bekannt, hat sich Oduponkpehe zu einer riesigen Wohnstadt für Pendler entwickelt, die in Accra arbeiten, aber der Enge der Hauptstadt entfliehen wollten. Die rasante, oft ungeplante Bebauung hat zu erheblichen infrastrukturellen Herausforderungen geführt, insbesondere bei der Abfallwirtschaft und der Entwässerung während der Regenzeit. Trotzdem blüht die lokale Wirtschaft durch unzählige kleine Handwerksbetriebe und informelle Straßenmärkte auf. Geografie K7 — Zersiedelung.",
      hu: "Oduponkpehe egy tradicionális, főként helyiek által használt elnevezés a Középső Régió rohamosan fejlődő területére, amely ma már Kasoa néven ismert. Az egykor kicsiny falu mára egy kaotikus, de élettel teli agglomerációs piaccá vált, amely híd a főváros és a partvidéki nyugati területek között. Társadalom K7 — településnevek változása.",
      ro: "Oduponkpehe este un nume profund ancorat în istorie care se suprapune cu inima modernă și haotică a urbei Kasoa. Ca nucleu spiritual, acesta se concentrează în jurul pieței Oduponkpehe Market, un teren de tranzacții vibrante care unifică triburile Ga și fermierii vecini. Sătenii de aici aduc de decenii bunuri de la poalele dealurilor pentru a le vinde locuitorilor metropolei. Denumirea oficială servește ca un avertisment că orașul își menține independența culturală, în ciuda faptului că e asimilat de Marea Accra. Istorie K6 — tranziția denumirilor urbane.",
      en: "Oduponkpehe is the traditional and official name for the massive urban sprawl more commonly known as Kasoa, located in the Awutu Senya East Municipal District of the Central Region. Evolving from a small market village founded by migrants, it has exploded into one of Ghana's most congested and densely populated commuter cities. The area serves as a massive residential overflow for Greater Accra, offering cheaper real estate while suffering from severe traffic bottlenecks along the main coastal highway. Its economy is dominated by the colossal Kasoa Market and thousands of informal retail enterprises catering to the rapidly expanding population. Geography K7 — mega-city overflow."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Früher als Kasoa Zongo bekannt", "Riesige Wohnstadt für Accra-Pendler", "Rasantes und oft ungeplantes Wachstum", "Infrastrukturelle Herausforderungen bei Entwässerung", "Blühende informelle Straßenmärkte", "Viele kleine Handwerksbetriebe"],
      hu: ["A település modern és ismertebb neve Kasoa", "Hagyományosan az Awutu nép területéhez tartozik", "Az ország egyik legdinamikusabban növekvő ingatlanpiaca", "Főutcáját naponta több ezer Accra felé ingázó jármű keresztezi", "Hatalmas regionális piaca az ország minden tájáról vonz árusokat", "Népessége az elmúlt 20 évben többszörösére duzzadt"],
      ro: ["Reprezintă denumirea istorică tradițională pentru așezarea Kasoa.", "Centrul acestuia funcționează ca o uriașă piață informală de alimente.", "Zona a fuzionat rapid administrativ din cauza densității navetiștilor.", "Sunt prezente tabere considerabile dedicate procesării fierului vechi.", "Consiliul său tradițional local continuă să reglementeze viața culturală.", "Rata sa rapidă de extindere ridică provocări imense de infrastructură sanitară."],
      en: ["The traditional and official name for the city widely known as Kasoa.", "Located in the Awutu Senya East Municipal District of the Central Region.", "Functions as a hyper-dense residential dormitory for Greater Accra workers.", "The massive central market is a primary driver of the local economy.", "Positioned directly on the highly congested Accra-Cape Coast highway.", "Characterized by rapid, largely informal urban real estate expansion."]
    }
